   "end": 24.26,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "bench | both | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 0.8
  },
  {
   "n": 17,
   "text": "He always saved me the last pickle.",
   "start": 24.26,
   "end": 25.93,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "bench | Rio hands a pickle | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 1.67
  },
  {
   "n": 18,
   "text": "Then the jokes started.",
   "start": 25.93,
   "end": 27.07,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "canteen | kids pointing | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 1.14
  },
  {
   "n": 19,
   "text": "\"Are you two married?\"",
   "start": 27.07,
   "end": 28.15,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "canteen | Crowd1 teasing | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 1.08
  },
  {
   "n": 20,
   "text": "\"Scaredy cat and his bodyguard.\"",
   "start": 28.15,
   "end": 29.43,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "canteen | Crowd2 teasing | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 1.28
  },
  {
   "n": 21,
   "text": "They laughed in the halls. They laughed at lunch.",
   "start": 29.43,
   "end": 31.61,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "playground | circle of kids laughing | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 2.18
  },
  {
   "n": 22,
   "text": "Kai said, \"Two useless gifts. Perfect match.\"",
   "start": 31.61,
   "end": 34.11,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "playground | Kai leaning in | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 2.5
  },
  {
   "n": 23,
   "text": "One day, I'd had enough.",
   "start": 34.11,
   "end": 35.09,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "playground | Narrator angry | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 0.98
  },
  {
   "n": 24,
   "text": "I knew our gifts would fit together. I asked Rio for his.",
   "start": 35.09,
   "end": 37.72,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "bench | Narrator asks | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 2.63
  },
  {
   "n": 25,
   "text": "\"I'll keep you safe,\" I said. \"Every minute. I promise.\"",
   "start": 37.72,
   "end": 41.16,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "bench | Narrator | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 3.44
  },
  {
   "n": 26,
   "text": "Rio looked at me for a long time.",
   "start": 41.16,
   "end": 42.72,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "bench | Rio | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 1.56
  },
  {
   "n": 27,
   "text": "\"Why do you think I'm always with you?\" he said.",
   "start": 42.72,
   "end": 43.95,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "bench | Rio | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 1.23
  },
  {
   "n": 28,
   "text": "\"Nothing feels dangerous when you're here.\"",
   "start": 43.95,
   "end": 46.31,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "bench | Rio | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 2.36
  },
  {
   "n": 29,
   "text": "Then he gave it to me anyway.",
   "start": 46.31,
   "end": 47.67,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "bench | glowing orb | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 1.36
  },
  {
   "n": 30,
   "text": "Alone, our gifts were nothing.",
   "start": 47.67,
   "end": 49.27,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "bench | orb fades into his hands | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 1.6
  },
  {
   "n": 31,
   "text": "Together, I always knew the exact second to be strong.",
   "start": 49.27,
   "end": 51.9,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "playground | Narrator lifts the can, eyes glow | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 2.63
  },
  {
   "n": 32,
   "text": "I won every game. Every race.",
   "start": 51.9,
   "end": 53.9,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "playground | race | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 2.0
  },
  {
   "n": 33,
   "text": "Even Kai couldn't touch me.",
   "start": 53.9,
   "end": 55.14,
   "src": null,
   "src_dur": null,
   "motion": "push_in",
   "transition": "cut",
   "grade": "neutral",
   "placeholder": "playground | Kai swings, falls | 1.6",
   "override": {},
   "dur": 1.24
  },
  {
   "n": 34,
   "text": "Everyone wanted to sit with me now.",
